<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    position: 'relative',
    background: '#0B3D2E',
    padding: 0,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Image src="assets/meeting_scene.png" style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '100%', height: '100%',
        objectFit: 'cover',
        opacity: 0.15,
    }} />
    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '100%', height: '100%',
        background: 'linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(11,61,46,.97) 0%, rgba(11,61,46,.90) 58%, rgba(11,61,46,.74) 100%)',
    }} />

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '100%', height: '720px',
        padding: '64px 72px 52px 72px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        justifyContent: 'space-between',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 34,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#F7F3EA',
                letterSpacing: 1,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                真正用於決策的時間
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 54 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{
                    fontSize: 200,
                    fontWeight: 'bold',
                    color: 'transparent',
                    backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #C75B12 0%, #F0A050 100%)',
                    backgroundClip: 'text',
                    lineHeight: 0.9,
                    fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", serif',
                    letterSpacing: -4,
                }}>
                    15
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, paddingBottom: 34 }}>
                    <Text style={{
                        fontSize: 40,
                        fontWeight: 'bold',
                        color: '#F7F3EA',
                        letterSpacing: 6,
                        fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", serif',
                    }}>
                        分鐘
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.60)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                        而這十五分鐘，往往發生在所有人都已經疲憊的時候
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: 0, minHeight: 0, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, borderLeft: '1px solid rgba(240,160,80,.34)', paddingLeft: 40 }}>
                <Text style={{
                    fontSize: 23,
                    color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.92)',
                    lineHeight: 1.7,
                    fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
                }}>
                    會議效率的真實問題，不是效率不夠，
                    <br />
                    而是<span style={{ color: '#F0A050', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>產出物不對</span>。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.68)', lineHeight: 1.78 }}>
                    我們花大量時間交換信息，而那些信息用半小時就能說完；我們把真正的決定拖到最後十分鐘，而在那個時候通過的，往往只是最容易被通過的那個版本。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 2, background: 'rgba(240,160,80,.42)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.48)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>05 / 14</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
